OL,3,GNEWSAOwl pellets reveal thriving mammal
OL,4,Apopulation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMammal Society volunteer Ian Bond said:
OL,7,F"This is almost certainly the only
OL,8,Fplace in the region where barn owls can
OL,9,Fchoose from such a wide menu."
